  "archetype": "logistics.express.air_and_road_cn",
  "summary": {
    "zh": "中国快递物流龙头，三年、两个合并分部（顺丰本体 / 嘉里物流）、七种燃料按品种披露。航空煤油单独一项占范围一近三分之二 —— 这是本仓库里燃料侧最完整的一份真实数据。",
    "en": "China's largest express logistics group. Three years, two consolidation segments (SF excluding KLN / Kerry Logistics), seven fuel carriers disclosed separately. Aviation kerosene alone drives close to two-thirds of Scope 1 — the most fuel-complete real dataset in this repo."
  },
