      "published_at": "2026-03-30",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-08-13",
      "notes": "Environmental KPI appendix, pp.137-138. Energy follows HKEX ESG Reporting Guide Appendix 2 and GB/T 2589-2020, using 277.778 kWh/GJ and 0.03412 kgce/MJ. KLN = Kerry Logistics Network (0636.HK), a listed holding subsidiary reported as a separate column."
    }
